WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.849
The reproduction contributes four things: it
re-runs the model and baseline to check each claim;

00:00:05.929 --> 00:00:09.617
it documents the synthetic data generators the
paper omitted;

00:00:09.697 --> 00:00:13.323
it adds a cleaner setup separating training and
test series;

00:00:13.403 --> 00:00:18.140
and it shows some benchmarks let the model win by
memorising seen transitions.
